    <DataNode elementId="AT5G59290-MONOMER" textLabel="UDP-glucuronic acid decarboxylase 3" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9FIE8" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="335" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Nicotiana tabacum UXS3&lt;/i&gt; gene encodes a protein (AtUXS3) with UDP-glucuronate decarboxylase activity |CITS:[12481102]|, involved in the conversion of UDP-glucuronate into UDP-xylose. Unlike AtUXS1 and AtUXS2, this enzyme does not possess a hydrophobic N-terminal domain thought to anchor the protein in endomembranes; the C-terminus moiety of the protein supposedly faces the lumen of endomembrane compartments |CITS:[12481102]|. AtUXS3 has a very high substrate specificity for UDP-GlcA. UDP-glucose, UDP-galactose, UDP-mannose, GDP-glucose, GDP-mannose and UDP-galacturonate were not used as substrates |CITS:[12481102]|. This enzyme does not require exogenously added NAD&lt;sup&gt;+&lt;/sup&gt;, although the cofactor is required for activity. Moreover, the addition of NADH, NADPH or NADP&lt;sup&gt;+&lt;/sup&gt; failed to inhibit the activity of AtUXS3. It is therefore thought that NAD&lt;sup&gt;+&lt;/sup&gt; is tightly bound to the protein |CITS:[12481102]|. AtUXS3 has a broad pH range (pH 4.5 to 9.5) but is completely inactive at pH values below 3.2 (interestingly, at this pH, preincubation of the enzyme with NAD&lt;sup&gt;+&lt;/sup&gt; retains 60% of enzyme activity |CITS:[12481102]|). In addition, the enzyme also displays a broad temperature range: 22?C to 42?C. No activity was detected beyond 55?C.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G59290-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT5G59290.2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9FIE8" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="AAK70882" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="UDP-XYL synthase 3" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="UDP-glucuronate decarboxylase 3" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="UGD" />
      <Property key="Synonym_4" value="UXS-3" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-11466" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT5G59290.2" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT5G59290" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_12481102" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_15655675" />
    </DataNode>
